## Why This Is Asked

Assess edge ML design at scale: latency, privacy, drift, and device heterogeneity in a warehouse setting.

## Key Concepts

- Edge inference optimization (quantization, pruning)
- Federated learning and secure aggregation
- Concept drift detection and continual learning
- Monitoring, rollout, and rollback strategies

## Code Example

