## Why This Is Asked
Production anomaly systems face non-stationarity, sparse labels, and strict latency. This question tests end-to-end design, from data schema to deployment, plus practical techniques like self-supervised pretraining and online adaptation.

## Key Concepts
- Self-supervised pretraining for unlabeled streams
- Online adaptation with meta-learning
- Two-tower architecture for heterogeneous features
- Drift detection and safe rollout/rollback
- Latency budgeting and quantization

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example gating logic for latency-adaptive routing
function route(payload, limitMs) {
  const t0 = performance.now();
  const score = computeScore(payload);
  const dt = performance.now() - t0;
  if (dt > limitMs) return 'fallback';
  return score;
}
```

